%% W3D7 — Distributed Tracing (LangSmith) — Request Flow
%% Shows span creation, async batching, eval attachment, and dataset export
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Engineer
    participant App as Application
    participant SDK as LangSmith SDK
    participant LSApi as LangSmith API
    participant LLM as LLM Provider

    Engineer->>App: User query arrives
    App->>SDK: @traceable fires — create root Run (run_id=abc)
    SDK->>SDK: Store run_id in ContextVar
    App->>SDK: Retriever call — create child Run (parent_run_id=abc)
    App->>LLM: Embed query + vector search
    LLM-->>App: Top-5 document chunks with scores
    App->>SDK: Capture retriever outputs (chunks + scores)
    App->>SDK: LLM call — create child Run (parent_run_id=abc)
    App->>LLM: POST assembled prompt
    LLM-->>App: Completion text + token usage
    App->>SDK: Capture LLM outputs (completion, tokens, latency_ms)
    Note over SDK: Root run end_time recorded
    SDK->>SDK: Batch completed runs in async queue
    SDK->>LSApi: POST /runs/batch (flush every 500ms)
    LSApi-->>SDK: 200 OK — run tree stored
    alt Automated evaluator configured
        LSApi->>LLM: LLM-as-a-Judge prompt (answer vs. retrieved docs)
        LLM-->>LSApi: Grounding score 0.0–1.0
        LSApi->>LSApi: Attach feedback to root run (key=factual_accuracy)
    else Human review triggered (score below threshold)
        Engineer->>LSApi: POST /feedback (run_id=abc, score=0.2)
        LSApi-->>Engineer: Feedback stored against run
    end
    Engineer->>LSApi: GET /runs?filter=feedback_score lt 0.4
    LSApi-->>Engineer: Filtered low-score runs returned
    Engineer->>LSApi: POST /datasets/examples (bulk export)
    LSApi-->>Engineer: Dataset created for fine-tuning
